        "cached_at": 1778663176
      },
      {
        "id": 48351,
        "name": "Kero Kero Keroppi no Daibouken",
        "summary": "Kero Kero Keroppi no Daibouken is based on the popular Sanrio character Keroppi. Released on the Nintendo Family Computer console in Japan in 1991.\n\nBig Adventure is a children's puzzle game where Keroppi must rescue his girlfriend Keroleen who is locked up in a castle. To do so, he must solve the action based puzzles in seven differently themed worlds with four different types of stages (the surface of the maze, flying a plane, a Reversi-like level, and through a field of lava). All the items in the game are pre-determined; there is a need to memorize the pattern for each playthrough so that a player may advance through the levels more quickly once they have achieved a degree of expertise in the game.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/y1ymgzrdylqow7anrwxd.jpg",
